      "html": "\n<style data-kid=\"0\">\n  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; background: #f7f5f0; color: #1a2133; }\n  h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6 { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; }\n</style>\n\n\n<nav style=\"background:#f7f5f0; border-bottom:1px solid #e5e1d8; position:sticky; top:0; z-index:50;\" data-kid=\"1\">\n  <div style=\"max-width:1280px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 40px; height:68px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;\" data-kid=\"2\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\" data-kid=\"3\">\n      <div style=\"width:36px; height:36px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a5c35,#2a8a52); border-radius:10px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\" data-kid=\"4\">\n        <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-kid=\"5\"><path d=\"M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5\" data-kid=\"6\"></path></svg>\n      </div>\n      <span style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif; font-size:20px; font-weight:800; color:#1a2133; letter-spacing:-0.02em;\" data-kid=\"7\">KaziPro</span>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:32px;\" data-kid=\"8\">\n      <a href=\"#\" style=\"font-size:14px; font-weight:500; color:#4a5568; text-decoration:none;\" data-kid=\"9\">Services</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" style=\"font-size:14px; font-weight:500; color:#4a5568; text-decoration:none;\" data-kid=\"10\">Comment ça marche</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" style=\"font-size:14px; font-weight:500; color:#4a5568; text-decoration:none;\" data-kid=\"11\">À propos</a>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px;\" data-kid=\"12\">\n      <button style=\"font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:#1a5c35; background:none; border:1px solid #1a5c35; border-radius:10px; padding:9px 20px; cursor:pointer;\" data-kid=\"13\">Connexion</button>\n      <button style=\"font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:white; background:#e07a1f; border:none; border-radius:10px; padding:9px 20px; cursor:pointer;\" data-kid=\"14\">Inscription gratuite</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</nav>\n\n\n<section style=\"background:linear-gradient(145deg, #13182a 0%, #1a5c35 55%, #1d6b41 100%); position:relative; overflow:hidden; padding:80px 40px 60px;\" data-kid=\"15\">\n  <div style=\"pointer-events:none; position:absolute; inset:0;\" data-kid=\"16\">\n    <div style=\"position:absolute; inset:0; opacity:0.04; background-image:linear-gradient(to right,white 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(to bottom,white 1px,transparent 1px); background-size:56px 56px;\" data-kid=\"17\"></div>\n    <div style=\"position:absolute; top:-80px; right:-5%; width:600px; height:600px; border-radius:50%; background:rgba(224,122,31,0.22); filter:blur(80px);\" data-kid=\"18\"></div>\n    <div style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-20%; left:-5%; width:480px; height:480px; border-radius:50%; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08); filter:blur(80px);\" data-kid=\"19\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"max-width:1280px; margin:0 auto; position:relative; z-index:2;\" data-kid=\"20\">\n    <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:7fr 5fr; gap:64px; align-items:center;\" data-kid=\"21\">\n      \n      <div data-kid=\"22\">\n        <div style=\"display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; padding:8px 16px; border-radius:100px; background:rgba(52,211,153,0.15); border:1px solid rgba(52,211,153,0.35); color:#6ee7b7; font-size:13px; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:28px;\" data-kid=\"23\">\n          <span style=\"position:relative; display:inline-flex; width:8px; height:8px;\" data-kid=\"24\">\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; inset:0; border-radius:50%; background:#34d399; opacity:0.6; animation:ping 1.5s infinite;\" data-kid=\"25\"></span>\n            <span style=\"position:relative; display:inline-flex; width:8px; height:8px; border-radius:50%; background:#34d399;\" data-kid=\"26\"></span>\n          </span>\n          47 professionnels disponibles en ce moment\n        </div>\n        <p style=\"font-size:11px; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.18em; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55); margin-bottom:16px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\" data-kid=\"27\">\n          <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e07a1f\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" data-kid=\"28\"><polygon points=\"12,2 15.09,8.26 22,9.27 17,14.14 18.18,21.02 12,17.77 5.82,21.02 7,14.14 2,9.27 8.91,8.26\" data-kid=\"29\"></polygon></svg>\n          Artisans et techniciens vérifiés en RDC\n        </p>\n        <h1 style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif; font-size:58px; font-weight:800; line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:-0.02em; color:white; margin-bottom:24px;\" data-kid=\"30\">\n          Trouvez un professionnel<br data-kid=\"31\">fiable pour <span style=\"color:#e07a1f;\" data-kid=\"32\">chaque projet</span>\n        </h1>\n        <p style=\"font-size:19px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.82); line-height:1.65; max-width:540px; margin-bottom:40px;\" data-kid=\"33\">\n          Devis détaillés, contrats clairs et paiement sécurisé par Mobile Money. Un parcours simple, du besoin jusqu'à la mission réalisée.\n        </p>\n        \n        <div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; padding:10px; border-radius:18px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1); backdrop-filter:blur(16px); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14); max-width:580px; margin-bottom:36px;\" data-kid=\"34\">\n          <div style=\"flex:1; position:relative;\" data-kid=\"35\">\n            <svg style=\"position:absolute; left:14px; top:50%; transform:translateY(-50%); pointer-events:none;\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#9ca3af\" stroke-width=\"2\" data-kid=\"36\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\" data-kid=\"37\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.35-4.35\" data-kid=\"38\"></path></svg>\n            <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Ex. électricité, plomberie, peinture…\" style=\"width:100%; height:50px; padding-left:44px; padding-right:16px; border-radius:12px; background:#f7f5f0; border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.1); font-size:15px; font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif; color:#1a2133; outline:none;\" data-kid=\"39\">\n          </div>\n          <button style=\"background:#e07a1f; color:white; border:none; border-radius:12px; padding:0 28px; font-size:15px; font-weight:700; font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif; cursor:pointer; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; white-space:nowrap;\" data-kid=\"40\">\n            Rechercher\n            <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" data-kid=\"41\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\" data-kid=\"42\"></path></svg>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:28px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85); font-size:14px;\" data-kid=\"43\">\n          <span style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\" data-kid=\"44\">\n            <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e07a1f\" stroke-width=\"2\" data-kid=\"45\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\" data-kid=\"46\"></path></svg>\n            Contrats et signatures\n          </span>\n          <span style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\" data-kid=\"47\">\n            <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e07a1f\" stroke-width=\"2\" data-kid=\"48\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" data-kid=\"49\"></circle><polyline points=\"12,6 12,12 16,14\" data-kid=\"50\"></polyline></svg>\n            Réponses rapides des pros\n          </span>\n          <span style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\" data-kid=\"51\">\n            <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e07a1f\" stroke-width=\"2\" data-kid=\"52\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\" data-kid=\"53\"></path><polyline points=\"22,4 12,14.01 9,11.01\" data-kid=\"54\"></polyline></svg>\n            Prestataires vérifiés\n          </span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:16px;\" data-kid=\"55\">\n        <div style=\"border-radius:20px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18); background:rgba(255,255,255,0.07); backdrop-filter:blur(20px); padding:32px; box-shadow:0 24px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);\" data-kid=\"56\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start; justify-content:space-between; margin-bottom:24px;\" data-kid=\"57\">\n            <div data-kid=\"58\">\n              <p style=\"font-size:11px; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.12em; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5); margin-bottom:4px;\" data-kid=\"59\">Exemple récent</p>\n              <p style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif; font-size:19px; font-weight:700; color:white;\" data-kid=\"60\">Profils vérifiés</p>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; padding:6px 12px; border-radius:100px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.12); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); color:white; font-size:12px; font-weight:600;\" data-kid=\"61\">\n              <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#e07a1f\" stroke=\"#e07a1f\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-kid=\"62\"><polygon points=\"12,2 15.09,8.26 22,9.27 17,14.14 18.18,21.02 12,17.77 5.82,21.02 7,14.14 2,9.27 8.91,8.26\" data-kid=\"63\"></polygon></svg>\n              Qualité\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius:14px; padding:16px 18px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; margin-bottom:20px;\" data-kid=\"64\">\n            <div style=\"width:50px; height:50px; border-radius:50%; background:rgba(224,122,31,0.3); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; flex-shrink:0;\" data-kid=\"65\">\n              <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e07a1f\" stroke-width=\"2\" data-kid=\"66\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\" data-kid=\"67\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\" data-kid=\"68\"></circle><path d=\"M6.168 18.849A4 4 0 0 1 10 17h4a4 4 0 0 1 3.832 1.849\" data-kid=\"69\"></path></svg>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"min-width:0; flex:1;\" data-kid=\"70\">\n              <p style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif; font-weight:700; color:white; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:3px;\" data-kid=\"71\">Jean-Baptiste M.</p>\n              <p style=\"font-size:13px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7); margin-bottom:8px;\" data-kid=\"72\">Électricien certifié</p>\n              <div style=\"display:flex; gap:14px; font-size:12px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\" data-kid=\"73\">\n                <span style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:4px;\" data-kid=\"74\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#e07a1f\" stroke=\"#e07a1f\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-kid=\"75\"><polygon points=\"12,2 15.09,8.26 22,9.27 17,14.14 18.18,21.02 12,17.77 5.82,21.02 7,14.14 2,9.27 8.91,8.26\" data-kid=\"76\"></polygon></svg>4.9/5</span>\n                <span data-kid=\"77\">128 missions terminées</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <button style=\"width:100%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; padding:14px 16px; border-radius:12px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14); color:white; font-size:15px; font-weight:600; font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif; cursor:pointer;\" data-kid=\"78\">\n            Explorer les professions\n            <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" data-kid=\"79\"><path d=\"M9 18l6-6-6-6\" data-kid=\"80\"></path></svg>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:12px;\" data-kid=\"81\">\n          <div style=\"border-radius:14px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14); background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05); backdrop-filter:blur(8px); padding:18px 20px;\" data-kid=\"82\">\n            <div style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif; font-size:26px; font-weight:800; color:white; margin-bottom:4px;\" data-kid=\"83\">500+</div>\n            <div style=\"font-size:12px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\" data-kid=\"84\">Prestataires vérifiés</div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"border-radius:14px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14); background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05); backdrop-filter:blur(8px); padding:18px 20px;\" data-kid=\"85\">\n            <div style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif; font-size:26px; font-weight:800; color:white; margin-bottom:4px;\" data-kid=\"86\">1 200+</div>\n            <div style=\"font-size:12px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\" data-kid=\"87\">Missions réalisées</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:16px; margin-top:56px; padding-top:40px; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\" data-kid=\"88\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius:14px; padding:16px 20px;\" data-kid=\"89\">\n        <div style=\"width:42px; height:42px; border-radius:10px; background:rgba(52,211,153,0.2); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; flex-shrink:0;\" data-kid=\"90\">\n          <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#34d399\" stroke-width=\"2\" data-kid=\"91\"><path d=\"M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\" data-kid=\"92\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\" data-kid=\"93\"></circle><path d=\"M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\" data-kid=\"94\"></path></svg>\n        </div>\n        <div data-kid=\"95\">\n          <div style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif; font-size:22px; font-weight:800; color:white;\" data-kid=\"96\">47</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\" data-kid=\"97\">En ligne</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius:14px; padding:16px 20px;\" data-kid=\"98\">\n        <div style=\"width:42px; height:42px; border-radius:10px; background:rgba(224,122,31,0.25); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; flex-shrink:0;\" data-kid=\"99\">\n          <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e07a1f\" stroke-width=\"2\" data-kid=\"100\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\" data-kid=\"101\"></path><polyline points=\"22,4 12,14.01 9,11.01\" data-kid=\"102\"></polyline></svg>\n        </div>\n        <div data-kid=\"103\">\n          <div style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif; font-size:22px; font-weight:800; color:white;\" data-kid=\"104\">500+</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\" data-kid=\"105\">Référencés</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius:14px; padding:16px 20px;\" data-kid=\"106\">\n        <div style=\"width:42px; height:42px; border-radius:10px; background:rgba(251,191,36,0.2); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; flex-shrink:0;\" data-kid=\"107\">\n          <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"rgba(251,191,36,0.5)\" stroke=\"#fbbf24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-kid=\"108\"><polygon points=\"12,2 15.09,8.26 22,9.27 17,14.14 18.18,21.02 12,17.77 5.82,21.02 7,14.14 2,9.27 8.91,8.26\" data-kid=\"109\"></polygon></svg>\n        </div>\n        <div data-kid=\"110\">\n          <div style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif; font-size:22px; font-weight:800; color:white;\" data-kid=\"111\">4,8</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\" data-kid=\"112\">Note moyenne</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius:14px; padding:16px 20px;\" data-kid=\"113\">\n        <div style=\"width:42px; height:42px; border-radius:10px; background:rgba(56,189,248,0.2); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; flex-shrink:0;\" data-kid=\"114\">\n          <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2\" data-kid=\"115\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\" data-kid=\"116\"></path><polyline points=\"22,4 12,14.01 9,11.01\" data-kid=\"117\"></polyline></svg>\n        </div>\n        <div data-kid=\"118\">\n          <div style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif; font-size:22px; font-weight:800; color:white;\" data-kid=\"119\">1 200+</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\" data-kid=\"120\">Projets terminés</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section style=\"padding:80px 40px; background:#f7f5f0;\" data-kid=\"121\">\n  <div style=\"max-width:1280px; margin:0 auto;\" data-kid=\"122\">\n    <div style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:56px;\" data-kid=\"123\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:11px; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.18em; color:#1a5c35; margin-bottom:12px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:8px;\" data-kid=\"124\">\n        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1a5c35\" stroke-width=\"2\" data-kid=\"125\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" data-kid=\"126\"></rect><rect x=\"14\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" data-kid=\"127\"></rect><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" data-kid=\"128\"></rect><rect x=\"14\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" data-kid=\"129\"></rect></svg>\n        Nos services\n      </p>\n      <h2 style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif; font-size:42px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:-0.02em; color:#1a2133; margin-bottom:16px; line-height:1.1;\" data-kid=\"130\">Tous les corps de métier</h2>\n      <p style=\"font-size:17px; color:#6b7280; max-width:520px; margin:0 auto; line-height:1.65;\" data-kid=\"131\">Parcourez les métiers disponibles sur KaziPro et trouvez le bon professionnel.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:20px;\" data-kid=\"132\">\n      \n      <div style=\"border-radius:16px; border:1px solid #e5e1d8; background:white; padding:24px; box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); transition:all 0.2s; cursor:pointer;\" data-kid=\"133\">\n        <div style=\"width:52px; height:52px; border-radius:14px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#facc15,#f97316); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin-bottom:18px; box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(249,115,22,0.3);\" data-kid=\"134\">\n          <svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" data-kid=\"135\"><polygon points=\"13,2 3,14 12,14 11,22 21,10 12,10\" data-kid=\"136\"></polygon></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif; font-size:17px; font-weight:700; color:#1a2133; margin-bottom:8px;\" data-kid=\"137\">Électricité</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size:13px; color:#9ca3af; margin-bottom:16px; line-height:1.5;\" data-kid=\"138\">Installation, réparation et mise aux normes électriques.</p>\n        <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; border-top:1px solid #f3f0ea; padding-top:14px;\" data-kid=\"139\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; color:#6b7280;\" data-kid=\"140\"><strong style=\"color:#1a2133; font-size:15px;\" data-kid=\"141\">24</strong> prestataires</span>\n          <span style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:4px; color:#e07a1f; font-size:13px; font-weight:600;\" data-kid=\"142\">Voir <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" data-kid=\"143\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\" data-kid=\"144\"></path></svg></span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"border-radius:16px; border:1px solid #e5e1d8; background:white; padding:24px; box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); cursor:pointer;\" data-kid=\"145\">\n        <div style=\"width:52px; height:52px; border-radius:14px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#60a5fa,#06b6d4); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin-bottom:18px; box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(6,182,212,0.3);\" data-kid=\"146\">\n          <svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" data-kid=\"147\"><path d=\"M12 2.69l5.66 5.66a8 8 0 1 1-11.31 0z\" data-kid=\"148\"></path></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif; font-size:17px; font-weight:700; color:#1a2133; margin-bottom:8px;\" data-kid=\"149\">Plomberie</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size:13px; color:#9ca3af; margin-bottom:16px; line-height:1.5;\" data-kid=\"150\">Robinetterie, tuyauterie, réparations sanitaires.</p>\n        <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; border-top:1px solid #f3f0ea; padding-top:14px;\" data-kid=\"151\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; color:#6b7280;\" data-kid=\"152\"><strong style=\"color:#1a2133; font-size:15px;\" data-kid=\"153\">18</strong> prestataires</span>\n          <span style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:4px; color:#e07a1f; font-size:13px; font-weight:600;\" data-kid=\"154\">Voir <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" data-kid=\"155\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\" data-kid=\"156\"></path></svg></span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"border-radius:16px; border:1px solid #e5e1d8; background:white; padding:24px; box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); cursor:pointer;\" data-kid=\"157\">\n        <div style=\"width:52px; height:52px; border-radius:14px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f59e0b,#ea580c); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin-bottom:18px; box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(245,158,11,0.3);\" data-kid=\"158\">\n          <svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" data-kid=\"159\"><path d=\"M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z\" data-kid=\"160\"></path></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif; font-size:17px; font-weight:700; color:#1a2133; margin-bottom:8px;\" data-kid=\"161\">Menuiserie</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size:13px; color:#9ca3af; margin-bottom:16px; line-height:1.5;\" data-kid=\"162\">Meubles sur mesure, portes, fenêtres et boiseries.</p>\n        <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; border-top:1px solid #f3f0ea; padding-top:14px;\" data-kid=\"163\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; color:#6b7280;\" data-kid=\"164\"><strong style=\"color:#1a2133; font-size:15px;\" data-kid=\"165\">15</strong> prestataires</span>\n          <span style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:4px; color:#e07a1f; font-size:13px; font-weight:600;\" data-kid=\"166\">Voir <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" data-kid=\"167\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\" data-kid=\"168\"></path></svg></span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"border-radius:16px; border:1px solid #e5e1d8; background:white; padding:24px; box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); cursor:pointer;\" data-kid=\"169\">\n        <div style=\"width:52px; height:52px; border-radius:14px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#a855f7,#ec4899); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin-bottom:18px; box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(168,85,247,0.3);\" data-kid=\"170\">\n          <svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" data-kid=\"171\"><path d=\"M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 0 1 2-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2M7 7h10\" data-kid=\"172\"></path></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif; font-size:17px; font-weight:700; color:#1a2133; margin-bottom:8px;\" data-kid=\"173\">Peinture</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size:13px; color:#9ca3af; margin-bottom:16px; line-height:1.5;\" data-kid=\"174\">Peinture intérieure, extérieure, décoration murale.</p>\n        <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; border-top:1px solid #f3f0ea; padding-top:14px;\" data-kid=\"175\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; color:#6b7280;\" data-kid=\"176\"><strong style=\"color:#1a2133; font-size:15px;\" data-kid=\"177\">21</strong> prestataires</span>\n          <span style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:4px; color:#e07a1f; font-size:13px; font-weight:600;\" data-kid=\"178\">Voir <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" data-kid=\"179\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\" data-kid=\"180\"></path></svg></span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"text-align:center; margin-top:40px;\" data-kid=\"181\">\n      <button style=\"display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; padding:13px 28px; border-radius:12px; border:1px solid #1a5c35; color:#1a5c35; background:transparent; font-size:15px; font-weight:600; font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif; cursor:pointer;\" data-kid=\"182\">\n        Voir tous les services\n        <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" data-kid=\"183\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\" data-kid=\"184\"></path></svg>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section style=\"padding:80px 40px; background:white; border-top:1px solid #e5e1d8;\" data-kid=\"185\">\n  <div style=\"max-width:1280px; margin:0 auto;\" data-kid=\"186\">\n    <div style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:60px;\" data-kid=\"187\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:11px; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.18em; color:#1a5c35; margin-bottom:12px;\" data-kid=\"188\">Comment ça marche</p>\n      <h2 style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif; font-size:42px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:-0.02em; color:#1a2133; margin-bottom:16px;\" data-kid=\"189\">En 4 étapes simples</h2>\n      <p style=\"font-size:17px; color:#6b7280; max-width:480px; margin:0 auto; line-height:1.65;\" data-kid=\"190\">Du besoin à la mission accomplie, tout est encadré sur KaziPro.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:0; position:relative;\" data-kid=\"191\">\n      \n      <div style=\"position:absolute; top:40px; left:calc(12.5%); right:calc(12.5%); height:2px; background:linear-gradient(to right,#1a5c35,#e07a1f); opacity:0.25;\" data-kid=\"192\"></div>\n      \n      <div style=\"padding:0 24px; text-align:center; position:relative;\" data-kid=\"193\">\n        <div style=\"width:80px; height:80px; border-radius:50%; background:#1a5c35; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin:0 auto 24px; box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(26,92,53,0.35);\" data-kid=\"194\">\n          <svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\" data-kid=\"195\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\" data-kid=\"196\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.35-4.35\" data-kid=\"197\"></path></svg>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:inline-block; background:#f0f7f3; color:#1a5c35; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:100px; margin-bottom:12px;\" data-kid=\"198\">Étape 1</div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif; font-size:18px; font-weight:700; color:#1a2133; margin-bottom:10px;\" data-kid=\"199\">Publiez votre demande</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; color:#6b7280; line-height:1.6;\" data-kid=\"200\">Décrivez votre projet et recevez des devis de pros qualifiés en 24h.</p>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div style=\"padding:0 24px; text-align:center; position:relative;\" data-kid=\"201\">\n        <div style=\"width:80px; height:80px; border-radius:50%; background:#2a8a52; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin:0 auto 24px; box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(42,138,82,0.35);\" data-kid=\"202\">\n          <svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\" data-kid=\"203\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\" data-kid=\"204\"></path><polyline points=\"14,2 14,8 20,8\" data-kid=\"205\"></polyline><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"13\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"13\" data-kid=\"206\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"17\" data-kid=\"207\"></line></svg>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:inline-block; background:#f0f7f3; color:#1a5c35; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:100px; margin-bottom:12px;\" data-kid=\"208\">Étape 2</div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif; font-size:18px; font-weight:700; color:#1a2133; margin-bottom:10px;\" data-kid=\"209\">Comparez les devis</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; color:#6b7280; line-height:1.6;\" data-kid=\"210\">Consultez les offres détaillées et choisissez le meilleur rapport qualité/prix.</p>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div style=\"padding:0 24px; text-align:center; position:relative;\" data-kid=\"211\">\n        <div style=\"width:80px; height:80px; border-radius:50%; background:#c96a10; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin:0 auto 24px; box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(201,106,16,0.35);\" data-kid=\"212\">\n          <svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\" data-kid=\"213\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\" data-kid=\"214\"></path></svg>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:inline-block; background:#fef3e7; color:#c96a10; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:100px; margin-bottom:12px;\" data-kid=\"215\">Étape 3</div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif; font-size:18px; font-weight:700; color:#1a2133; margin-bottom:10px;\" data-kid=\"216\">Signez le contrat</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; color:#6b7280; line-height:1.6;\" data-kid=\"217\">Formalisez l'accord avec signature électronique sécurisée et traçable.</p>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div style=\"padding:0 24px; text-align:center; position:relative;\" data-kid=\"218\">\n        <div style=\"width:80px; height:80px; border-radius:50%; background:#e07a1f; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin:0 auto 24px; box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(224,122,31,0.35);\" data-kid=\"219\">\n          <svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\" data-kid=\"220\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"4\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\" data-kid=\"221\"></rect><line x1=\"1\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"23\" y2=\"10\" data-kid=\"222\"></line></svg>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:inline-block; background:#fef3e7; color:#c96a10; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:100px; margin-bottom:12px;\" data-kid=\"223\">Étape 4</div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif; font-size:18px; font-weight:700; color:#1a2133; margin-bottom:10px;\" data-kid=\"224\">Payez en Mobile Money</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; color:#6b7280; line-height:1.6;\" data-kid=\"225\">Règlement sécurisé via M-Pesa ou autres opérateurs, après validation.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section style=\"padding:80px 40px; background:#f7f5f0;\" data-kid=\"226\">\n  <div style=\"max-width:1280px; margin:0 auto;\" data-kid=\"227\">\n    <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:80px; align-items:center;\" data-kid=\"228\">\n      <div data-kid=\"229\">\n        <p style=\"font-size:11px; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.18em; color:#1a5c35; margin-bottom:12px;\" data-kid=\"230\">Pourquoi KaziPro</p>\n        <h2 style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif; font-size:40px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:-0.02em; color:#1a2133; margin-bottom:20px; line-height:1.15;\" data-kid=\"231\">La confiance au cœur de chaque mission</h2>\n        <p style=\"font-size:16px; color:#6b7280; line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:40px;\" data-kid=\"232\">KaziPro vérifie chaque prestataire, encadre les paiements et protège les deux parties avec des contrats numériques légaux.</p>\n        <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:20px;\" data-kid=\"233\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:16px;\" data-kid=\"234\">\n            <div style=\"width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:12px; background:#f0f7f3; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; flex-shrink:0;\" data-kid=\"235\">\n              <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1a5c35\" stroke-width=\"2\" data-kid=\"236\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\" data-kid=\"237\"></path><polyline points=\"22,4 12,14.01 9,11.01\" data-kid=\"238\"></polyline></svg>\n            </div>\n            <div data-kid=\"239\">\n              <h4 style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif; font-weight:700; color:#1a2133; margin-bottom:4px; font-size:15px;\" data-kid=\"240\">Profils vérifiés</h4>\n              <p style=\"font-size:13px; color:#6b7280; line-height:1.5;\" data-kid=\"241\">Chaque professionnel passe une vérification d'identité et de compétences.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:16px;\" data-kid=\"242\">\n            <div style=\"width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:12px; background:#fef3e7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; flex-shrink:0;\" data-kid=\"243\">\n              <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e07a1f\" stroke-width=\"2\" data-kid=\"244\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\" data-kid=\"245\"></path></svg>\n            </div>\n            <div data-kid=\"246\">\n              <h4 style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif; font-weight:700; color:#1a2133; margin-bottom:4px; font-size:15px;\" data-kid=\"247\">Contrats numériques</h4>\n              <p style=\"font-size:13px; color:#6b7280; line-height:1.5;\" data-kid=\"248\">Documents légaux signés électroniquement, archivés et accessibles.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:16px;\" data-kid=\"249\">\n            <div style=\"width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:12px; background:#f0f7f3; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; flex-shrink:0;\" data-kid=\"250\">\n              <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1a5c35\" stroke-width=\"2\" data-kid=\"251\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"4\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\" data-kid=\"252\"></rect><line x1=\"1\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"23\" y2=\"10\" data-kid=\"253\"></line></svg>\n            </div>\n            <div data-kid=\"254\">\n              <h4 style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif; font-weight:700; color:#1a2133; margin-bottom:4px; font-size:15px;\" data-kid=\"255\">Paiement sécurisé</h4>\n              <p style=\"font-size:13px; color:#6b7280; line-height:1.5;\" data-kid=\"256\">Fonds bloqués jusqu'à validation de la mission par le client.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:16px;\" data-kid=\"257\">\n        <div style=\"background:white; border-radius:16px; border:1px solid #e5e1d8; padding:24px; box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\" data-kid=\"258\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:3px; margin-bottom:14px;\" data-kid=\"259\">\n            <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#e07a1f\" stroke=\"none\" data-kid=\"260\"><polygon points=\"12,2 15.09,8.26 22,9.27 17,14.14 18.18,21.02 12,17.77 5.82,21.02 7,14.14 2,9.27 8.91,8.26\" data-kid=\"261\"></polygon></svg>\n            <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#e07a1f\" stroke=\"none\" data-kid=\"262\"><polygon points=\"12,2 15.09,8.26 22,9.27 17,14.14 18.18,21.02 12,17.77 5.82,21.02 7,14.14 2,9.27 8.91,8.26\" data-kid=\"263\"></polygon></svg>\n            <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24