y:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif; font-size:26px; font-weight:800; color:#1a2133; margin-bottom:8px;\" data-kid=\"163\">Vous ne trouvez pas votre service ?</h2>\n      <p style=\"font-size:15px; color:#6b7280; line-height:1.65;\" data-kid=\"164\">Décrivez votre besoin — nous vous orientons vers les bons corps de métier.</p>\n    </div>\n    <button style=\"flex-shrink:0; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; padding:14px 28px; border-radius:12px; background:#e07a1f; color:white; font-size:15px; font-weight:700; font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif; border:none; cursor:pointer; white-space:nowrap;\" data-kid=\"165\">\n      Publier une demande\n      <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" data-kid=\"166\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\" data-kid=\"167\"></path></svg>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<footer style=\"background:#13182a; padding:28px 40px;\" data-kid=\"168\">\n  <div style=\"max-width:1280px; margin:0 auto; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;\" data-kid=\"169\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\" data-kid=\"170\">\n      <div style=\"width:28px; height:28px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a5c35,#2a8a52); border-radius:7px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\" data-kid=\"171\">\n        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" data-kid=\"172\"><path d=\"M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5\" data-kid=\"173\"></path></svg>\n      </div>\n      <span style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-weight:800; color:white;\" data-kid=\"174\">KaziPro</span>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex; gap:24px;\" data-kid=\"175\">\n      <a href=\"#\" style=\"font-size:13px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5); text-decoration:none;\" data-kid=\"176\">Comment ça marche</a>\n      <a href=\"#\